{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Ball_Roling2.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marble run maker is a game about stacking physically simulated objects like books and toys to make a marble run. Bigger the marble run higher the score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Goal-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Start_and_End.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start here. End there. Build something wild in between. One goal, infinite possibilities. The only thing stopping you is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple control-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Controls4.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> move things around and Rotate to perfectly place where you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Undo System -</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/UndoExample.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a small mistake and everything fall ;_;? no worries just undo with <strong><i>ctrl + z</i></strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>And more fun mechanics are in devlopment</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">if your looking to chill and make stuff this is a perfect game for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to use Controls;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open ended puzzles meaning there is no one fit solution;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">no time pressure to solve the puzzle;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy Vibes;</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447420?t=1745004586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3447420?t=1745004586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/1f880b0b5a208c6594de973d68d632697effd1a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745004586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/1f880b0b5a208c6594de973d68d632697effd1a9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745004586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3630560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Ball_Roling2.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marble run maker is a game about stacking physically simulated objects like books and toys to make a marble run. Bigger the marble run higher the score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Your Goal-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Start_and_End.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start here. End there. Build something wild in between. One goal, infinite possibilities. The only thing stopping you is your creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Simple control-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447420/extras/Controls4.gif?t=1745004586\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> move things around and Rotate to perfectly place where you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Undo System -</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta